y|fog|foggy|humid|humidity|thunderstorms?|heat wave)\\b.*\\b(during|on|at|in|of)\\b.*\\b(battle|july (1|2|3)|gettysburg|1863|pickett|charge|cannonade|retreat)\\b","\\b(battle|july (1|2|3)|gettysburg|1863|pickett|charge|cannonade)\\b.*\\b(weather|rain|raining|rained|rainy|temperature|cloudy|sunny|foggy|humid|humidity|heat wave|thunderstorm)\\b","\\b(how (?:hot|cold|warm)|was it (?:a |very |so )?(?:hot|cold|warm|raining|rainy|sunny|cloudy|foggy|humid|muddy|dry))\\b.*\\b(battle|july (1|2|3)|gettysburg|1863|pickett|charge|cannonade|retreat)\\b","\\b(battle|july (1|2|3)|gettysburg|1863|pickett|charge|cannonade|retreat)\\b.*\\b(how (?:hot|cold|warm)|was it (?:a |very |so )?(?:hot|cold|warm|raining|rainy|sunny|cloudy|foggy|humid|muddy|dry))\\b"],"text":"The site's records do not include a weather series for the battle, so I cannot give temperatures or a day-by-day forecast."}]}